+// deep JIT<->PBL recursion) and, for a Catch, replaced the real exception with
+// the empty rfe.exception (undefined). GECKO_PBL_OLDREUNWIND=1 restores the
+// old re-raise (A/B).
+static void PBLReraiseUnwindException(JSContext* cx) {
